From: Torsten Duwe <duwe@suse.de>

Add a driver for the clocks in RP1, starting with ETH_TSU.
Derived from Linux drivers/clk/clk-rp1.c.

Signed-off-by: Torsten Duwe <duwe@suse.de>
Co-authored-by: Oleksii Moisieiev <oleksii_moisieiev@epam.com>
---

While not strictly required in this series, this patch completes a
minimal RP1 support, as far as required for U-Boot. Network boot will
later only need adaptions of the MACB ethernet code to the AXI and
PCIe bridges.

---
